<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA PLANS NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA PLANS NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish edible fats firm Kruszwica SA plans to pay no dividend for 1996 and to put 4.1 million zlotys of its 7.1-million-zloty net profit into reserves, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The rest would go to supervisory board members and to bonuses for employees.</p>
<p>Shareholders vote on the proposal on June 26.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
